n the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, October to November came in at 54% of normal and November to December at 40%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 38% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, with grid 18795 lowest at 58%.</p>"}
